{"id": "224565", "name": "סכום פואסון ואחיד – חישוב F_Y(π)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהיו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\sim\\mathsf{Poi}\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\sim\\mathsf{U}\\left[0,1\\right]\\)</span> בלתי תלויים. נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y=X+U\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F_Y(\\pi)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-e\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: את \\(e\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">e</code> ואת \\(\\pi\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">pi</code>, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">e^(-3)*(1+pi)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מתנים בערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span>: רק ערכים שלמים קטנים מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> תורמים, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\)</span> מוסיף חלק שבור.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — נוסחת ההסתברות השלמה</b><br>לפי אי-התלות<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F_Y(\\pi)=\\mathbb{P}[X+U\\leq\\pi]=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\mathbb{P}[X=k]\\,\\mathbb{P}[U\\leq \\pi-k] \\]</p>כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k\\leq 2\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi-k> 1\\)</span> ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}[U\\leq\\pi-k]=1\\)</span>; כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k=3\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}[U\\leq\\pi-3]=\\pi-3\\)</span>; וכאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k\\geq 4\\)</span> ההסתברות 0.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הצבה</b><br>עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}[X=k]=e^{-{{CT:0}} }\\frac{ {{CT:0}}^k}{k!}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F_Y(\\pi)=e^{-{{CT:0}} }\\left(1+{{CT:0}}+\\frac{ {{CT:0}}^2}{2}+\\frac{ {{CT:0}}^3}{6}(\\pi-3)\\right)=e^{-{{CT:0}} }\\left({{CT:1}}+{{CT:2}}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}-\\frac12\\right)\\right) \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 40, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["la", "ta"], "nvariants": 15}